<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  SYNTHETIC test fixture: an APPROVED Dell firmware catalogue.

  NOT a real Dell Catalog.xml. It mirrors the documented Dell "Manifest" schema
  shape (<SoftwareComponent> with <Name><Display>, <Version><Display>,
  <DellVersion>, and a `path` package identity) so the verification script's
  parsing and matching logic can be exercised offline. The component-name to
  idrac_firmware_info ElementName mapping is model-specific and MUST be
  confirmed against a real catalogue in lab before firmware apply is enabled.

  Versions here match ansible/tests/offline/inventory.yml
  dell_host_baseline_fixture_firmware, so an approved run reports no drift.
-->
